{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to book a sound bath or ask questions about sessions, private bookings, and accessibility." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --earth-1:#2f1b12; /* deep earth */
      --earth-2:#6f3f2c; /* clay */
      --warm-1:#d99a6c; /* sand */
      --warm-2:#f3e6d8; /* parchment */
      --accent:#b57a4b; /* bronze */
      --muted:#7a6a5d;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      --radius:14px;
      --max-width:980px;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--warm-2) 0%, #fff 60%);
      color:var(--earth-1);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45;
      padding:48px 20px;
    }
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;position:relative}

    /* decorative pattern: layered warm ovals and subtle grain */
    .bg-visual{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:-1;}
    .bg-visual svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}

    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .brand h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;color:var(--earth-1);letter-spacing:0.6px}
    .brand p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--earth-1);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass)}

    main{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.85), rgba(255,255,255,0.98));border-radius:18px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(47,27,18,0.08)}

    /* hero */
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .hero h2{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:var(--earth-1);line-height:1.05}
    .hero p.lead{margin:12px 0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* myth vs truth */
    .myths{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(181,122,75,0.06), rgba(111,63,44,0.02));padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(175,135,110,0.06)}
    .card h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--earth-1)}
    .card p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* pillars */
    .pillars{display:flex;gap:14px;margin:22px 0}
    .pillar{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(245,236,224,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.4));border:1px solid rgba(181,122,75,0.08)}
    .pillar h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:var(--earth-2)}
    .pillar p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* case notes (testimonials) */
    .cases{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin:18px 0}
    .case{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,236,224,0.8);border-left:4px solid var(--accent)}
    .case p{margin:0;color:var(--earth-1)}
    .case small{display:block;margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.66);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(175,135,110,0.06)}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--earth-1)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(47,27,18,0.08);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--earth-2);color:var(--warm-2);border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer}
    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(47,27,18,0.06);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px}

    /* faq list */
    .faq{margin-top:18px}
    .faq details{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;border:1px solid rgba(175,135,110,0.04)}
    details summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:var(--earth-1)}
    details p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .brand h1{font-size:18px}
      nav{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-visual" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 800" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <radialGradient id="g1" cx="30%" cy="20%" r="60%">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f7efe6" stop-opacity="1" />
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#d99a6c" stop-opacity="0.12" />
        </radialGradient>
        <radialGradient id="g2" cx="80%" cy="80%" r="50%">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#fff7f1" stop-opacity="0.9" />
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#6f3f2c" stop-opacity="0.06" />
        </radialGradient>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g1)" />
      <ellipse cx="20%" cy="15%" rx="380" ry="180" fill="#b57a4b" opacity="0.04"/>
      <ellipse cx="85%" cy="75%" rx="420" ry="220" fill="#6f3f2c" opacity="0.03"/>
      <g fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.02">
        <circle cx="940" cy="160" r="10" />
        <circle cx="960" cy="200" r="6" />
        <circle cx="915" cy="130" r="5" />
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
        <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="events.html">Next & Events</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Sessions</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Tariff</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <h2>Reach the resonance — let's make a time to listen</h2>
          <p class="lead">Write to us to inquire about upcoming sound baths, private circles, or corporate offerings. We move in slow rhythm: gentle arrival, a layered sound journey, and a careful return to stillness.</p>

          <div class="myths" aria-hidden="false">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>Myth</h3>
              <p>Sound baths are loud, chaotic, and only for meditative experts.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>Truth</h3>
              <p>The session is curated. Volume and instruments are chosen for comfort — it is accessible to curious beginners and seasoned listeners alike.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillars" role="list">
            <div class="pillar" role="listitem">
              <h4>Sensory Care</h4>
              <p>We prioritize gentle dynamics, tactile comfort, and gradual transitions so the body can receive sound safely.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar" role="listitem">
              <h4>Intentionality</h4>
              <p>Each gathering is an arc: arrival, immersion, grounding — facilitated to hold space for reflection and rest.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar" role="listitem">
              <h4>Craft & Instruments</h4>
              <p>We blend crystal bowls, gong textures, chimes and tuning forks to create a bespoke, layered resonance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cases">
            <div class="case">
              <p>"I arrived buzzing and left like a quiet lake. The instruments held me in a gentle curve of sound."</p>
              <small>— {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} recounted</small>
            </div>
            <div class="case">
              <p>"Our office booked a private session; the team reported feeling lighter and more focused the next day."</p>
              <small>— Corporate wellness, {{VENUE_NAME}}</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- contact form column -->
        <aside>
          <form id="contactForm" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First & last" required>

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>

            <div class="grid">
              <div>
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="type">I'm interested in</label>
                <select id="type" name="type">
                  <option>Upcoming public event</option>
                  <option>Private 1:1 session</option>
                  <option>Couples or friends</option>
                  <option>Corporate / team</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="when">Preferred dates</label>
            <input id="when" name="when" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Weeknights, weekends, or specific dates">

            <label for="message">Tell us briefly</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Any accessibility needs, sensory concerns, or intentions for the session"></textarea>

            <div class="actions">
              <button class="btn-primary" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <button class="btn-ghost" type="button" onclick="location.href='book.html'">See availability</button>
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer to call? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          </form>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <!-- CASE NOTES: practical flow and what to bring -->
      <section aria-labelledby="flow" style="margin-top:20px">
        <h3 id="flow" style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;color:var(--earth-1)">Session flow • what to expect</h3>
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)">A typical group sound bath moves through a considered rhythm: gentle arrival and check-in (10–15 min), guided settling and body awareness (10 min), immersive sound journey with layered instruments (35–45 min), and a soft return with grounding and optional sharing (10–15 min).</p>

        <div class="myths" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>What to bring</h3>
            <p>Mat or yoga mat, warm blanket, pillow for neck support, eye mask if you like, a water bottle, and any small comforts to make resting easy.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Contraindications & safety</h3>
            <p>High-sensitivity to sound, recent surgeries, pacemakers, or seizure history may need a conversation first. Pregnant participants: please consult your care provider. This practice is complementary and not a substitute for medical care.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section class="faq">
        <details>
          <summary>How long are sessions?</summary>
          <p>Public gatherings are typically 75–90 minutes. Private 1:1 sessions can range 60–90 minutes depending on intention.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Are instruments loud?</summary>
          <p>Volume is moderated for comfort. Instruments include crystal bowls, a gong for texture, chimes, and tuning forks; each is introduced with intention and care.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I book a private on short notice?</summary>
          <p>Often yes. Use the form above or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> to check same-week availability. For corporate bookings please allow two weeks when possible.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Where do you hold sessions?</summary>
          <p>We gather in warm, grounded spaces around {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — often at {{VENUE_NAME}}. Exact details are provided after booking.</p>
        </details>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section style="margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>
          <strong style="display:block;font-size:15px;color:var(--earth-1)">Prefer to book now?</strong>
          <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Secure a spot for the next evening of sound — the next event: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}.</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a href="book.html" class="btn-primary" style="text-decoration:none">Book a Session</a>
          <a href="events.html" class="btn-ghost" style="margin-left:8px;text-decoration:none">See Events Calendar</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <div>Questions? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div>© <span id="year">2026</span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    // small enhancement: set current year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
    // graceful form handler (no external analytics)
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      // allow default for now; placeholder for server integration
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Welcome to the sound bath site bundle — chunk 4.

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html  — The contact and connective hub for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.

About contact.html:
- Layout family: earthy_warm; voice: minimal_poetic.
- Sections included: hero, myth_vs_truth (presented as Myth vs Truth cards), pillars, case_notes, faq, cta.
- Visual richness is achieved with inline SVG gradients and layered shapes (no external assets).
- Accessibility: uses semantic elements (header, main, footer, details/summary) and simple form controls.

Key placeholders to replace in templates:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}
- {{VENUE_NAME}}
- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}

Sound bath specifics present on the contact page:
- A concise session flow (arrival, immersion, grounding).
- "What to bring" checklist and sensory comforts.
- Contraindications disclaimer (pregnancy, seizures, pacemakers, medical advice note).
- Instruments are mentioned as a curated mix (crystal bowls, gong, chimes, tuning forks) with moderated volume.

Customization notes:
- Update the form action ({{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}) to point to your booking endpoint or form processor.
- Colors and rounded radii are defined in :root CSS variables for quick theming.
- The inline SVG provides the background pattern; if you prefer a separate file, swap the svg block with a background-image referencing assets/img/pattern.svg and include that file in your build.

Usage:
- Drop contact.html into the site root or desired directory.
- Replace placeholders with your business data.
- Ensure other site pages (index.html, events.html, private-sessions.html, pricing.html, about.html, faq.html, book.html) exist and link consistently.

Design & voice notes:
- Navigation labels on this page are intentionally varied (Gatherings, Next & Events, Private Sessions, Tariff) to meet uniqueness requirements.
- The tone balances sensory detail and practical clarity — suitable for an events_series offering focused on premium, gentle experiences.

If you need alternate copies with different instrument lists or additional accessibility metadata, request a revision and specify which page to update."}
BUNDLE_END
